From 51276d4fa0cb220e19867e8f1ca1a7907d886d81 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: folia-linear-build <folia-linear-build@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 15:46:20 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Linear linearstats

Paper-side linearstats readout: a Bukkit command showing per-folder
timing snapshots, a shared folder-identity helper, async flush-completion
events (Bukkit and Paper-native) plus a JDK-only stats delegate for
plugins. Display is pull-only with no new storage fields and no extra
threads; the bridge fires once per coordinator flush that attempted at
least one file, dropping clean-no-op flushes, and ships a sync entry
point for the server-internal save path alongside the async one.
